rs  helped those whose lives they've saved  onto the shore on the Greek island of  agatha neesee the twenty-year-old boat  driver is met by Greek police he  subsequently admitted he never driven a  boat before he's now facing accusations  of the manslaughter of three small  children Lisa Holland Sky News in the  Aegean Sea
 

